# Grishnak, the SRD 5.2.1 Priest: two attacks, Mace (1d6 + 3 Bludgeoning and
# 2d4 Radiant) or Radiant Flame (2d10 Radiant, 60 feet); Wisdom spellcasting,
# save DC 13 (casting bonus 5). innate creature label uses action|bonus
# spells...: Spirit Guardians once a day, and Divine Aid's spells three times a
# day as a Bonus Action. evil: her Spirit Guardians deal Necrotic damage.
creature grishnak 13 38 0 30 5 1 6 3 5 2 10 0 60 60 0 0 5 1 0
saves grishnak 3 0 1 1 3 1
damage_types grishnak bludgeoning radiant
multiattack grishnak 2
multiattack_ranged grishnak
melee_extra_damage grishnak 2 4 radiant
innate grishnak Spellcasting 1 action spirit_guardians
innate grishnak Divine_Aid 3 bonus bless dispel_magic healing_word lesser_restoration
evil grishnak
